-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §118: a second deputy and those after him get
-- §39's role allowances by its rules; "לעניין סעיף 39(ג)" the deputyship
-- allowance is one of his two.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common
IMPORT `39`

§ `118 גמולי תפקיד לסגני מנהלים שניים ומעלה`

@ref akn:art_118__para_a
GIVEN c IS A `allowance case`
      `approved by the district manager` IS A BOOLEAN
      roles IS A LIST OF `role`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a second deputy's role allowances under §39` c `approved by the district manager` roles IS
    `the role allowances paid` c `approved by the district manager` roles

-- (ב): F-ofek-hadash-base-118-a: the two-role cap is §39(ב), not (ג) (as
-- F-ofek-hadash-base-131-a). Read §39(ב): with the deputyship allowance, one
-- role allowance more (convention reading.misprint).
@ref akn:art_118__para_b
GIVEN `approved by the district manager` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `role allowances a second deputy may add` `approved by the district manager` IS
    `role allowances payable at most` `approved by the district manager` MINUS 1

`the clause 118(ב) names` MEANS "39(ג)"
`118(ב) names §39(ג) for the two-role cap` MEANS NOT (`the clause 118(ב) names` EQUALS "39(ב)")
#ASSERT `118(ב) names §39(ג) for the two-role cap`
#ASSERT `role allowances a second deputy may add` FALSE EQUALS 1
